556	     * Derives an owner's region code, preferring the postcode: the region whose {@link #REGION_POSTCODES}
557	     * range contains the (4-digit) postcode is returned, falling back to the fixed {@link #CITY_REGION}
558	     * city table when the postcode is absent or in no known range, and finally to {@code "UNKNOWN"}.
559	     *
560	     * @param postcode the owner's postcode, may be {@code null}
561	     * @param city the owner's city, used to resolve the region when the postcode does not
562	     * @return the canonical region string, or {@code "UNKNOWN"} when neither source resolves a region
563	     */
564	    /**
565	     * The fixed version tag mixed into the region code used inside the version-2 identifiers (member id,
566	     * household id and identity key), so every identifier differs from the value version 1 produced. The
567	     * tag is only ever mixed into the identifiers' derivation; it never appears in the plain region used
568	     * for {@code locality}, {@code timezone} or the owner segment.
569	     */
570	    private static final String IDENTITY_VERSION_TAG = "V2";
