573	     * Derives the version-2 region code used inside the identifiers: the plain region with the fixed
574	     * {@link #IDENTITY_VERSION_TAG 'V2'} version tag prefixed (e.g. {@code "V2NSW"}). This mirrors the
575	     * mapper's {@code regionCodeV2} so the member id, household id and identity key are all derived over
576	     * the same tagged region.
